{"id":"63e59320a814619c","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-kraft-converse.md","title":"Converse Kraft Inequality","display":"thm-kraft-converse — Converse Kraft Inequality","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-kraft-converse","aliases":["43-thm-kraft-converse"],"display":"thm-kraft-converse — Converse Kraft Inequality","depends_on":["[[43-df-prefixfree]]","[[43-df-string]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"§6.6, noneffective converse Kraft construction","source_printed_pages":"100","source_pdf_pages":"120","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-kraft-converse"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-kraft-converse</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kraft-converse — Converse Kraft Inequality"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e7071caa967351d5\" href=\"?note=e7071caa967351d5\" title=\"43-df-prefixfree\">43-df-prefixfree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1cb4649e6af56ba4\" href=\"?note=1cb4649e6af56ba4\" title=\"43-df-string\">43-df-string</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§6.6, noneffective converse Kraft construction"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"100"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"120"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\ell_i)_{i\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\">\\((\\ell_i)_{i\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrefixFree}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrefixFree}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e7071caa967351d5\" href=\"?note=e7071caa967351d5\" title=\"43-df-prefixfree\">43-df-prefixfree</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{i=0}^{\\infty}2^{-\\ell_i}\\le1\\to\\exists p:\\mathbb N\\to\\Sigma^*\\;\\left(\\mathrm{PrefixFree}(\\operatorname{ran}p)\\land\\left(\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;|p(i)|=\\ell_i\\right)\\land\\left(\\forall i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\;(i\\ne j\\Rightarrow p(i)\\ne p(j))\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sum_{i=0}^{\\infty}2^{-\\ell_i}\\le1\\to\\exists p:\\mathbb N\\to\\Sigma^*\\;\\left(\\mathrm{PrefixFree}(\\operatorname{ran}p)\\land\\left(\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;|p(i)|=\\ell_i\\right)\\land\\left(\\forall i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\;(i\\ne j\\Rightarrow p(i)\\ne p(j))\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补入不同请求必须使用不同代码的单射条件；仅要求像集前缀自由不能表达逐请求的无冲突分配。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，§6.6, noneffective converse Kraft construction；印刷页 100，PDF 页 120。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-prefixfree","status":"resolved","id":"e7071caa967351d5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixfree]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-string","status":"resolved","id":"1cb4649e6af56ba4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-string]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixfree","status":"resolved","id":"e7071caa967351d5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(\\ell_i)_{i\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}$；$\\mathrm{PrefixFree}$ 见 [[43-df-prefixfree]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(\\ell_i)_{i\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrefixFree}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_{i=0}^{\\infty}2^{-\\ell_i}\\le1\\to\\exists p:\\mathbb N\\to\\Sigma^*\\;\\left(\\mathrm{PrefixFree}(\\operatorname{ran}p)\\land\\left(\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;|p(i)|=\\ell_i\\right)\\land\\left(\\forall i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\;(i\\ne j\\Rightarrow p(i)\\ne p(j))\\right)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1452,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-128","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-kraft-converse]] — Converse Kraft Inequality"}],"outgoing":["e7071caa967351d5","1cb4649e6af56ba4"]}